<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?>
<MessageStudioText
	Format="1.2" xmlns="nintendo:msgstudio">
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c07r0301_badman_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>りくちを　ふやそうと　したけど
うみで　くらしている　ポケモンが▽
こまることに　きづいたんだよな……▼
おっと　かのじょには　ナイショだぜ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:31:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:27:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>陸地を　増やそうと　したけど
海で　暮らしている　ポケモンが▽
こまることに　気づいたんだよな……▼
おっと　彼女には　内緒だぜ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:49:14" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:48:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:27:10" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BADMAN</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:35:21" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData />
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c07r0301_rangerw_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>むかし　うみを　ひろげようとしたけど
りくの　ポケモンが　へっちゃうでしょ▼
それって　あたしらの
じこまんぞく　だとおもうと　ダサくて▼
あっ！　ダーリンには　ヒミツよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:49:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:34:20" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>昔　海を　広げようとしたけど
陸の　ポケモンが　減っちゃうでしょ▼
それって　あたしらの
自己満足だと　思うと　ダサくて▼
あっ！　ダーリンには　ヒミツよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:49:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:48:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:27:14" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>RANGERW</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:52:58" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c07r0301_trainerm_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あんなあ　ぼく
サウンドデザイナー　やねん！▼
ごきげんな　ミュージックを
みんなに　きいてもらいたくて▽
こうして　あちこち　まわってるんです▼
きみも　ぼくの　だいすきな
ミュージック　きいてくれへん？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:44:23" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:35:56" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あんなあ　ぼく
サウンドデザイナー　やねん！▼
ごきげんな　ミュージックを
みんなに　聴いてもらいたくて▽
こうして　あちこち　まわってるんです▼
きみも　ぼくの　大好きな
ミュージック　聴いてくれへん？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:49:34" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:48:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・はい/いいえの選択肢表示
　はい　→
　いいえ→
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:34:59" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>TRAINERM</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:34:34" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c07r0301_trainerm_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ほな　はじめるさかい
こころして　きいてや！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:47:52" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:47:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ほな　始めるさかい
こころして　聴いてや！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:49:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:48:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・はい選択時
・１０番道路のBGMを再生する
・BGMは電源を切るまでそのまま</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:52:16" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>TRAINERM</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:35:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c07r0301_trainerm_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>……おんがくに　むちゅう　だ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:50:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:47:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>……音楽に　夢中だ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:50:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:48:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・BGM切り替え後
・BGMは電源を切るまでそのまま</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:52:21" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>TRAINERM</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:35:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c07r0301_trainerm_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ちょ！　そない　えんりょ　せんでも
なんぼでも　きいてくださいよお！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:51:08" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:48:02" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ちょ！　そない　遠慮せんでも
なんぼでも　聴いてくださいよお！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:50:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:48:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・いいえ選択時
・再度会話するとtrainerm_01</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:45:38" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>TRAINERM</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T03:45:22" />
		</AttributeCell>
